<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 09:50:42 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>十月</title><link>https://some.pics/6abf7e6e80440</link><description>&lt;p&gt;十月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A new month. The image shows hands with red-painted nails clutching a black leather boot. This time, the text is written on the image: 
In German: 
An dich.
Gesehen werden willst du. Und versteckst dich bloß.
(Hinter dir.)
Freiheit willst du. Und sperrst dich doch nur ein.
(In dir.)
Fühlen möchtest du. Und verletzt Andere.
(Mit dir.)
Weisheit möchtest du. Und belügst dich immerzu.
(Aus dir.)
Liebe willst du. Und verwehrst sie doch.
(Dir.)
(Anderen.)

In English:
To you.
You want to be seen. Yet you merely hide.
(Behind you.)
You want freedom. Yet you only lock yourself away.
(Inside yourself.)
You want to feel. Yet you hurt others.
(With yourself.)
You want wisdom. Yet you lie to yourself all the time.
(From within yourself.)
You want love. Yet you deny it.
(To yourself.)
(To others.)" height="3964" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6abf7e6e80440.jpg" width="2906"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 09:50:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>徒步日，从Monstreux到Ronquières斜面升船机并返回，全程20公里</title><link>https://some.pics/6abf616a00fcf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;徒步日，从Monstreux到Ronquières斜面升船机并返回，全程20公里&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Heuvels, een boerderij en velden" height="2160" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6abf616a00fcf.jpg" width="3840"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 07:46:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>#1 苹果 - Inktober 2026</title><link>https://some.pics/6abf31e832168</link><description>&lt;p&gt;#1 苹果 - Inktober 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Line drawing on a square piece of paper of an apple tree with eaten apples at the foot of the tree. In the background are large buildings and smoke stacks polluting the air. A micron pen is laying next to the notebook." height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/wess/6abf31e832168.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://wess.some.pics"&gt;@wess&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 04:24:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>手绘图中，一个人留着卷发，戴着眼镜，蓄着短胡须，身穿灰色衬衫和牛仔裤。衬衫口袋里插着一支笔。</title><link>https://some.pics/6abf314baab3c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;手绘图中，一个人留着卷发，戴着眼镜，蓄着短胡须，身穿灰色衬衫和牛仔裤。衬衫口袋里插着一支笔。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Hand drawing of a person with curly hair, glasses, and a short beard wearing a grey shirt and jeans. A pen is sticking out of the shirt pocket." height="1566" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/wess/6abf314baab3c.jpg" width="652"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://wess.some.pics"&gt;@wess&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 04:21:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>阳光亲吻的悬崖

